            "description": "",
            "summary": "PainReform ( (PRFX) ) has provided an update. PainReform announced that its Phase 3 clinical trial for PRF-110 did not meet its primary endpoint of providing effective postoperative pain relief over 72 hours, as data from the final 24-hour period could not be clarified. Despite this setback, the company is engaging in further R&D efforts to refine the drug\u2019s pharmaco-kinetics and pharmaco-dynamics to potentially support future trials, reflecting their commitment to enhancing pain relief solution",
